## SVG Mechanism: AI Agent Loop

A standalone, zero-dependency HTML animated 2D architecture diagram illustrating the **AI Agent Loop** (`Planner -> Executor -> Verifier -> Commit`, with a `Retry` loop from `Verifier` back to `Planner` on check failure). It loads your existing `design/tokens.css` verbatim—without modifying `design/tokens.css` or hardcoding raw hex/RGB values inside `<svg>`—while providing non-overriding light/dark fallback tokens if opened standalone.

### Stages & Token Map

- **Stages & Branches:**
  - `1. Planner` (`Plan next step`) → sends planned work to `Executor` and receives retry feedback on check failure
  - `2. Executor` (`Run planned work`) → executes the plan and passes output to `Verifier`
  - `3. Verifier` (`Check output`) → advances on `Pass` to `Commit`, or routes via `Check failure · Retry` back to `Planner`
  - `4. Commit` (`Accept & commit`) → finalizes verified output
  - `Retry loop` → dashed warning feedback loop from `Verifier` bottom edge back into `Planner`
- **Direct CSS Token Bindings (zero raw hex inside `<svg>`):**
  - `--color-surface-default`: SVG backdrop canvas, node gradient bottom stop, step pill background, page & caption surfaces
  - `--color-surface-raised`: node gradient top stop, edge pill fills (`Pass`, `Check failure · Retry`), figure container surface
  - `--color-text-default`: stage numbers, node titles, `Pass` badge label, headings, active caption lead
  - `--color-text-muted`: header eyebrow, node sublabels, legend text, caption body
  - `--color-border-default`: dot-grid backdrop pattern, static primary track strokes, node card borders, UI control borders
  - `--color-action-primary-bg`: primary directional arrowheads, primary animated signal gradient, step badge rings, active node pulse dots, focus outlines
  - `--color-warning-text`: retry loop track, retry directional arrowhead, animated retry signal gradient, `Check failure · Retry` badge stroke & label

