### Interactive & Reduced-Motion Contract

- **Play / Pause (`data-mech-toggle`):** `<button type="button" aria-pressed="false">` (`min-width/height: 44px`, `:focus-visible` ring) toggles `data-paused="true"` on `.mech-figure`, pauses all CSS `stroke-dashoffset` and node pulse animations via `animation-play-state: paused`, invokes `svg.pauseAnimations()`/`unpauseAnimations()` when supported, and announces state changes in `aria-live="polite"`.
- **Keyboard Stage Inspection:** Stage buttons (`All stages`, `1. Planner`, `2. Executor`, `3. Verifier`, `4. Commit`, `Retry loop`) and focusable SVG nodes (`tabindex="0" role="button"`, `Enter`/`Space` supported) highlight the selected stage and its connected tracks while keeping inactive elements readable (`opacity: 0.58`) and updating the `aria-live="polite"` caption.
- **Reduced Motion (`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`):** Disables continuous signal motion (`animation: none !important; animation-play-state: paused !important;`) and initializes the toggle in paused state while preserving directional arrowheads, step numbers (`1`–`4`), `Pass`, and `Check failure · Retry` pills.

